From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:54:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(win): run win_flex with --wincompat for Engine scanners

flex 2.6.4's built-in skeleton includes <unistd.h>, which MSVC lacks
(C1083 in Base/Scanner.cpp). win_flex --wincompat uses <io.h> and the
Windows-compatible skeleton instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Sources/Ecc/parser.h           |  215 +-
 Sources/Engine/Base/Parser.cpp | 3659 ++++++++++++++++++--------------
 Sources/Engine/Base/parser.h   |  145 +-
 Sources/Engine/Engine.vcxproj  |   16 +-
 Sources/Engine/Ska/smcpars.h   |  120 +-
 5 files changed, 2481 insertions(+), 1674 deletions(-)

